WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.267
Installation and Wi-Fi problems with REau, and how to fix them

2
00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:09.600
1. Play Protect blocked the installation: that is expected on the Full edition

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:16.133
Pause app scanning in the Play Store, install the APK again and turn Play Protect back on afterwards

4
00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:22.533
2. Turning on Accessibility shows Restricted setting or App access denied

5
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:29.667
Try to turn it on first. Then, in Apps, REau, three-dot menu, tap Allow restricted settings

6
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:36.333
Go back to Accessibility and turn REau on. If the switch was grey, it is this restricted setting

7
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:41.400
On Samsung, REau's Accessibility is under Installed apps

8
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:49.267
3. Android Auto server off: on Full, turn on Accessibility and the Turn on the server automatically switch

9
00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:56.600
On Lite, turn it on by hand: Android Auto settings, three-dot menu, Start head unit server

10
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:04.267
4. Android Auto developer mode off: open its settings and tap Version ten times

11
00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:12.400
5. After Turn off, Android Auto takes up to a minute to close the previous session: wait or restart the server

12
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:21.200
6. A VPN is holding REau back: turn the VPN off or leave REau out of it with split tunneling, and reconnect the VPN

13
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:29.933
7. Dash Wi-Fi not found: check the bike key, that location is allowed and, in Bike data, the full network name

14
00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:35.800
If you changed motorcycle or there is more than one dash nearby, tap Forget and search again

15
00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:41.400
The first time, Android asks Connect to device: tap Connect

16
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:48.200
8. If Another app has the dash appears, stop the other app's streaming, such as the official app

17
00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:54.600
If the dash refuses the connection, turn the bike off with the key, wait about thirty seconds and turn it on again

18
00:01:54.600 --> 00:02:00.800
9. Android Auto has no picture: force stop Android Auto, turn REau off and on

19
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:07.467
10. If you turned on the network server, REau does not look for the dash: turn that switch off to use the bike

20
00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:11.467
More answers are in REau's frequently asked questions

